{"id":"84ce8c835a688c6a","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-cadlag.md","title":"Càdlàg","display":"df-cadlag — Càdlàg","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cadlag","aliases":["58-df-cadlag","Càdlàg"],"display":"df-cadlag — Càdlàg","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-reals]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cadlag"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cadlag</span><span>Càdlàg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cadlag — Càdlàg"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (real path, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\)</span> (càdlàg predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega\">\\(d\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|u\\|_2=(\\sum_{j&lt;d}u(j)^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|u\\|_2=(\\sum_{j&lt;d}u(j)^2)^{1/2}\\)</span> 为有限维欧氏范数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)\\)</span> 为向量值路径谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)\\)</span> 为下式定义的兼容谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to|X(s)-X(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in[0,t)\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;u\\to|X(u)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to|X(s)-X(t)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in[0,t)\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;u\\to|X(u)-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;d\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to\\|X(s)-X(t)\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^d\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;\n\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;s\\to\\|X(s)-\\ell\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;d\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s&lt;t+\\delta\\to\\|X(s)-X(t)\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^d\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;\n\\bigl(t-\\delta&lt;s\\to\\|X(s)-\\ell\\|_2&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\lor\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\lor\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Càdlàg: &quot;continue à droite, limitée à gauche&quot; = right-continuous with left limits</li>\n<li>Every martingale has càdlàg modification (Doob)</li>\n<li>Donsker: càdlàg paths for Brownian scaling limit; functional CLT</li>\n<li>Jump processes: càdlàg by definition; left limit at jump times</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Ethier and Kurtz, Markov Processes</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-reals]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)$ (real path, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\|u\\|_2=(\\sum_{j<d}u(j)^2)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cadlag} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(X,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\bigl(t\\leq s<t+\\delta\\to|X(s)-X(t)|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\Bigl[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in[0,t)\\;\\bigl(t-\\delta<u\\to|X(u)-\\ell|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&d\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^d)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(t\\leq s<t+\\delta\\to\\|X(s)-X(t)\\|_2<\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^d\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in[0,t)\\;\n\\bigl(t-\\delta<s\\to\\|X(s)-\\ell\\|_2<\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(X)\\lor\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(X,d).","display":true}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"bec60cf74d373d75","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e1e039b5b31a7f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]])."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-cadlag]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md|58-df-cadlag]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","c54af6fc6a780954"]}